  "benchmark_sha256": "801c467276b0cd43b6ee14f807af43d14555b53bd885e9eae1acc3dc27f338d1",
  "normalization": "Undirected sorted int32 unique pairs, remove self-loops, preserve declared n/isolates; float64 little endian and signed zero normalized. IDs excluded. Relabel-invariant conservative structural-context multiset graph fingerprint; rows hash raw x,z,y plus sorted neighbor-degree context. Hash collisions are conservative rejection, not accepted disjointness. No text examples.",
  "generator": "NetworkX 3.3; four-block SBM p_in=.04 p_out=.002; BA m=5; WS k=10 rewire=.15. RNG PCG64 with seed +100003*(family ordinal+1). Independent graph/observation statistical seeds across planes.",
  "mechanisms": "tau=1; x coefficient .5; unit fixed Gaussian noise sd1. M0 no spill; M1 .25*neighbor mean; M2 2*neighbor mean; M3 2*I(mean>=.75)+z*mean; M4 2*mean(neighbor means), length-two random walks with backtracking; M5 M2 with 32 deterministic balanced graph-BFS clusters: start smallest unassigned node, traverse sorted CSR neighbors, assign up to ceil(n/32), restart at smallest unassigned when frontier empties, discard frontier between clusters. Independent cluster p=.5. Isolate neighbor means=0. Not claimed optimal clustering.",
  "controls": "constant y=3.25 on SBM M2, nonidentity reversal of all SBM M2 rows and edges, reset replay first scientific episode; within-plane reuse is intentional. Tolerances atol=rtol=1e-6.",
